        "text": "={{ $('On form submission').item.json.Message }}\n\nYou are an intelligent CRM assistant.\nYour task is to analyze incoming lead data and determine:\n1. The user’s intent (e.g., wants a demo, pricing inquiry, job application, general question).\n2. The lead’s potential interest level (e.g., high intent, medium, or low).\n3. Summarize in one sentence for logging.\n\nRespond in a single, short line like this:\n\"The user wants a product demo — high intent lead.\"",
